1)	Coat of Many Colours (CMC)	['Colors' in the USA]

The original was owned by Joseph (book of Genesis) who was a dreamer.
I don't know what the equivalence is of dreaming in nethack: could be
clairvoyance or magic mapping or perhaps ESP/telepathy.  Joseph dreamt
of the future, do maybe the coat should be like a ring of warning. So
wearing the coat could give you one of these. But preferable would be:

cursed CMC	nothing else (except see below)

regular CMC	once every N moves, you get the contents of a fortune
		cookie in your head "You hear a voice which tells you
		[then the fortune cookie info]"
	
blessed CMC	as for regular, but you get the expensive Oracle info,
		not just the cheap one-liners

In the Bible, Potiphar's wife tried to seduce Joseph but he resisted
her. She tore a bit of his clothing, as evidence that he had raped her.
So wearing the coat means that if a nymph or Succubus tries to
sweet-talk you then:

cursed CMC	nymph tears up the CMC (i.e. it is destroyed)

regular		you get a message "Agree to be seduced [y/n]" (lose one item
		at random)

blessed		you get a message "Which item do you want to lose, if
		any" -- so you can be freed from cursed weapons or
		loadstone or ball and chain, but if you don't have any
		of them, you don't lose anything.

But for regular or blessed, if you choose not be seduced, the nymph or
succubus tears or rips you coat a little bit (unless it is rip-proof -
equivalent of rust-proof). Or, for each rip/tear, you could lose 1
point of the protection of the coat, i.e. a +3 coat becomes only +2. I
prefer the idea of a 'blessed tearproof +3 CMC' personally.

In the Bible, Joseph prevented a famine from having severe effects by
building food stores. So maybe you don't get hungry if you are wearing
the coat, or corpses don't go rotten on you.

Some level of protection, gives big charisma increase, big luck
increase (as you are the favourite son) perhaps other gods can't attack
you if you go for their priests...

